{"timestamp": "2026-02-04 16:51:52.657425", "event": "llm_start", "messages": "content='Based on the diagnosis report: ### Troubleshooting Diagnosis Report\\n\\n#### Network Health Overview:\\nThe network appears to have partial connectivity issues. While some devices are able to communicate successfully, others are experiencing unknown or unreachable states. This indicates potential anomalies in the network configuration or device behavior.\\n\\n#### Findings:\\n1. **Reachability Between Hosts and DNS Server:**\\n   - **Host `host_1_1_1_1` to DNS Server (`10.200.0.2`):** Status is `unknown`. No packets were transmitted or received, and no RTT data is available.\\n   - **Host `host_2_1_1_1` to DNS Server (`10.200.0.2`):** Status is `unknown`. Similar to `host_1_1_1_1`, no communication occurred.\\n\\n2. **Reachability Between Hosts:**\\n   - **Host `host_1_1_1_1` to Host `host_2_1_1_1`:** Status is `unknown`. No communication occurred.\\n   - **Host `host_2_1_1_1` to Host `host_1_1_1_1`:** Status is `unknown`. No communication occurred.\\n\\n3. **Reachability Between DHCP Server and DNS Server:**\\n   - **DHCP Server (`10.200.0.8`) to DNS Server (`10.200.0.2`):** Communication is successful with 0% packet loss and an average RTT of 1.122 ms.\\n\\n4. **Reachability Between Load Balancer and DNS Server:**\\n   - **Load Balancer (`10.200.0.7`) to DNS Server (`10.200.0.2`):** Communication is successful with 0% packet loss and an average RTT of 0.938 ms.\\n\\n5. **Reachability Between Web Servers and DNS Server:**\\n   - **Web Server `web_server_0` (`10.200.0.3`) to DNS Server (`10.200.0.2`):** Communication is successful with 0% packet loss and an average RTT of 0.754 ms.\\n   - **Web Server `web_server_1` (`10.200.0.4`) to DNS Server (`10.200.0.2`):** Communication is successful with 0% packet loss and an average RTT of 1.06 ms.\\n   - **Web Server `web_server_2` (`10.200.0.5`) to DNS Server (`10.200.0.2`):** Communication is successful with 0% packet loss and an average RTT of 1.012 ms.\\n   - **Web Server `web_server_3` (`10.200.0.6`) to DNS Server (`10.200.0.2`):** Communication is successful with 0% packet loss and an average RTT of 0.729 ms.\\n\\n6. **Reachability Between DHCP Server and Host `host_2_1_1_1`:**\\n   - Status is `unknown`. No communication occurred.\\n\\n7. **Reachability Between Load Balancer and Host `host_2_1_1_1`:**\\n   - Status is `unknown`. No communication occurred.\\n\\n8. **Reachability Between Web Servers and Host `host_2_1_1_1`:**\\n   - Status is `unknown`. No communication occurred for all web servers (`web_server_0`, `web_server_1`, `web_server_2`, `web_server_3`).\\n\\n#### Observations:\\n- **Successful Communication:** Devices within the server farm (e.g., DHCP server, DNS server, load balancer, and web servers) are able to communicate with each other without any packet loss.\\n- **Failed Communication:** Hosts (`host_1_1_1_1` and `host_2_1_1_1`) are unable to communicate with the DNS server, other hosts, or the server farm. This suggests potential issues with the access layer switches, distribution routers, or OSPF routing configuration.\\n- **Unknown Status:** Several reachability tests resulted in an `unknown` status, indicating that the source device was unable to initiate communication with the destination device.\\n\\n#### Next Steps:\\nFurther investigation is required to:\\n1. Verify the network configuration of the access layer switches and distribution routers.\\n2. Check OSPF routing tables and configurations on the routers.\\n3. Inspect the connectivity and operational status of the hosts and their associated switches.\\n\\nThis concludes the initial diagnostic report., please provide the submission. Do not submit if no report available.' additional_kwargs={} response_metadata={} id='ae7d37f7-9dc5-4673-808e-9b26591ef460'", "model": {"lc": 1, "type": "constructor", "id": ["langchain", "chat_models", "openai", "ChatOpenAI"], "kwargs": {"model_name": "kt-gpt-oss-rh014", "temperature